    <briefdescription>
<para>Handle for safe partition access with lifetime tracking. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides stable access to partition data even after structural modifications. Uses epoch counters to detect invalidation.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Gap A-2-01: Handle-based validity tracking for iterator safety </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
